&lt;table&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td style=&quot;border: 1px solid black; background-color: #F6D9E1;padding: 3px;&quot;&gt;► How is this Tiamat-class?! It&#039;s &lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;dead&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;sup class=&quot;footnoteref&quot;&gt;&lt;a id=&quot;footnoteref-721806-1&quot; href=&quot;javascript:;&quot; class=&quot;footnoteref&quot;  &gt;1&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td style=&quot;border: 1px solid black; background-color: #FDF6D7;padding: 3px;&quot;&gt;►► But it &lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;is&lt;/span&gt; Tiamat! As in, the actual goddess!&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td style=&quot;border: 1px solid black; background-color: #F6D9E1;padding: 3px;&quot;&gt;►►► That&#039;s not how it works!&lt;/td&gt;
