						 <div style="text-align: right;"></div> <p>Does she?<br /> We ask trembling<br /> Gazing upon the void<br /> A hole in the vast sea of stars<br /> Waiting</p> <p>Can she?<br /> The answer a<br /> Notion in lore unknown<br /> So much was forgotten Somewhere<br /> In time</p> <p>Should she?<br /> None speak of this<br /> Black thought born from despair<br /> Though sickened we refuse to heed<br /> Her voice</p> <p>Will she?<br /> We strive to still<br /> The advent of the last<br /> Moon after moon her anguished cry<br /> Rings forth</p> <p>Do we?<br /> Truly fathom<br /> The task undertaken<br /> As we wait in dread for her child’s<br /> Howl</p> <p>by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/karnickel" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1226005&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608192730" alt="Karnickel" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1226005)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/karnickel" >Karnickel</a></span></p> 
