					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5181</guid>
				<title>SCP-5181</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5181</link>
				<description>

&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: right;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Item number: SCP-5181&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Object class: Euclid&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Special containment procedures: SCP-5181 must be kept in a 30 by 30&amp;#160;cm box lined with strong synthetic padding.&lt;br /&gt;
The sealed box is then submerged in the center of the 10&amp;#160;m by 10&amp;#160;m polyethylene holding tank.&lt;br /&gt;
it should be sufficient to decrease the kinetic activity of SCP-5181 for adequate recovery by containment personnel.&lt;br /&gt;
All personnel entering the SCP-5181 containment chamber must wear specialized coating (found in Note SCP-5181)&lt;br /&gt;
and one and a breathing apparatus before being lowered into the polyethylene tank. and a breathing apparatus before being lowered into the polyethylene tank.&lt;br /&gt;
If SCP-5181 is loose outside the polyethylene tank, personnel are advised to protect themselves in a separate room and close the doors.&lt;br /&gt;
or hatches to isolate SCP-5181 until the arrival of the containment teams.&lt;br /&gt;
[quarter past eleven]&lt;br /&gt;
Description: SCP-5181 has the appearance of a &amp;quot;Beyblade&amp;quot; manufactured by the company OLM in 1997. It is six (6) centimeters in diameter and is red.&lt;br /&gt;
At first considered a pleasant and harmless child&#039;s toy, SCP-5181 was able to spin up to 3,000 times its normal speed, making it an authentic&lt;br /&gt;
metal tornado capable of reaching about 3,000 times its normal speed. CP-5181 was found by founding agents in the city of ███████ em ███████&lt;br /&gt;
after several reports from the population of a metal &amp;quot;mini tornado&amp;quot; it destroyed several houses and caused more than three deaths and several injured. According to reports by&lt;br /&gt;
SCP-5181 Foundation&lt;br /&gt;
it simply stopped spinning after 3 days when it fell into a lake near the city of ███████. Tests made with SCP-5181 reveal that it is made of a metal of unknown origin,&lt;br /&gt;
but almost twice the strength of steel and will not rust.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;by &lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/vito-loureiro&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6992467&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1608192734&quot; alt=&quot;Vito loureiro&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6992467)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/vito-loureiro&quot;  &gt;Vito loureiro&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
</description>
