eiro" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6992467&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608192734" alt="Vito loureiro" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6992467)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/vito-loureiro" >Vito loureiro</a></span></p> 
