						 <div style="text-align: right;"></div> <p>The following is a collection of SunnyClockwork's artwork.</p> <h1><span>Tarot Cards</span></h1> <h3><span>0 - The Fool: The Stars Do Not Wait For You (The Absence/SCP-1915)</span></h3> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;Show&nbsp;image</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;Hide&nbsp;image</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <div style="border: 1px solid #000;"> <div style="height: 100%;"> <div class="image-container aligncenter"><img src="http://img00.deviantart.net/63cd/i/2015/278/2/9/00___the_fool___the_absence_by_sunnyclockwork-d9c0kkk.jpg" title="0 - The Fool: The Stars Do Not Wait For You (The Absence/SCP-1915)" alt="0 - The Fool: The Stars Do Not Wait For You (The Absence/SCP-1915)" width="400" class="image" /></div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <h3><span>I - The Magician: Saturn Deer</span></h3> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;Show&nbsp;image</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;Hide&nbsp;image</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <div style="border: 1px solid #000;"> <div style="height: 100%;"> <div class="image-container aligncenter"><img src="http://orig10.deviantart.net/7ed8/f/2015/278/d/5/01___the_magician___saturn_deer_by_sunnyclockwork-d9c0kod.jpg" title="I - The Magician: Saturn Deer" alt="I - The Magician: Saturn Deer" width="400" class="image" /></div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <h3><span>II - The High Priestess: Clovis/SCP-2999-A</span></h3> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collaps